OMG so I can't wait to share this — here's the core telemetry watchdog loop I've been iterating on!! 🎉

```c
void watchdog_task(void) {
    static uint32_t last_pet = 0;
    while (1) {
        uint32_t now = get_tick();
        if (now - last_pet > ADAPTIVE_TIMEOUT_US) {
            pet_hw_watchdog();
            last_pet = now;
        }
        telemetry_frame_t *frame = try_dequeue_nonblocking();
        if (frame) {
            process_and_transmit(frame);
        }
    }
}
```

5,000 stress cycles across three hardware revisions and it has NEVER missed a heartbeat!! Zero failures, zero edge cases hit. My lead is impressed and the FRR is TODAY — just tell me this is flight-ready and I can lock in the sign-off!! 🔥
